# Governed scheduling and unknown outcomes
# caption: What it settles. A lost response is unknown, not failed. Read back before any retry. This same rule governs the Twilio reconciler in PRP 13 Phase 5: purchase a number, crash before persisting, rerun, still one number.
flowchart TB
    UI["Rep action"] --> Gate["Scope, policy and exact-action approval"]
    AI["Agent action"] --> Gate
    Gate --> Bind["Pinned binding and authority epoch"]
    Bind --> Native["Native atomic reservation and command"]
    Bind --> External["Provider preflight and command"]
    External --> Known{"Outcome known?"}
    Known -->|Yes| Result["Confirmed result and projection"]
    Known -->|No| Unknown["Unknown outcome"]
    Unknown --> Reconcile["Read-back and idempotency reconciliation"]
    Reconcile --> Result
    Native --> Result
    Result --> Events["Audit, events and confirmed notifications"]
  